{"scenario": "debug/partner-agent-investigates", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "doc": "An investigation on the mock adapter under the Autonomous preset: the agent reads the user's stopped session (its epoch), may not remove the user's breakpoint, sets its own (the editors get it with its agent, which the gutter rings), and after the user steps its step read at the old stop is refused (the user's step wins); its step at the new stop goes through. Pattern B: each call's turn gates the transcript read."}
{"do": "root"}
{"do": "sqlite", "path": "$DATA/work.db", "sql_file": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/work-db-6.sql"}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$CONFIG/settings.el", "mode": "600", "text": "(drgnx-settings :version 1 (drgnx-agents-profiles ((\"mock-claude\" :provider claude :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"claude\")))) (drgnx-agents-matrix (:preset autonomous)))\n"}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$ROOT/proj/.vscode/launch.json", "json": {"version": "0.2.0", "configurations": [{"type": "mock", "request": "launch", "name": "Mock", "program": "app"}]}}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$ROOT/script.json", "json": [{"expect": "initialize", "args": {"adapterID": "mock"}, "ok": {"supportsConfigurationDoneRequest": true}}, {"expect": "launch", "args": {"program": "app"}, "ok": {}}, {"event": "initialized"}, {"expect": "configurationDone"}, {"event": "stopped", "body": {"reason": "breakpoint", "threadId": 1, "allThreadsStopped": true}}, {"expect": "threads", "ok": {"threads": [{"id": 1, "name": "main"}]}}, {"expect": "stackTrace", "args": {"threadId": 1}, "ok": {"stackFrames": [{"id": 1000, "name": "main", "line": 9, "column": 1, "source": {"path": "/p/a.py"}}], "totalFrames": 1}}, {"expect": "scopes", "args": {"frameId": 1000}, "ok": {"scopes": [{"name": "Locals", "variablesReference": 7, "expensive": false}]}}, {"expect": "variables", "args": {"variablesReference": 7}, "ok": {"variables": [{"name": "total", "value": "9", "variablesReference": 0}]}}, {"expect": "setBreakpoints", "ok": {"breakpoints": [{"verified": true, "line": 12}]}}, {"expect": "setBreakpoints", "ok": {"breakpoints": [{"verified": true, "line": 12}, {"verified": true, "line": 14}]}}, {"expect": "next", "args": {"threadId": 1}, "ok": {}}, {"event": "stopped", "body": {"reason": "step", "threadId": 1, "allThreadsStopped": true}}, {"expect": "threads", "ok": {"threads": [{"id": 1, "name": "main"}]}}, {"expect": "stackTrace", "args": {"threadId": 1}, "ok": {"stackFrames": [{"id": 1000, "name": "main", "line": 10, "column": 1, "source": {"path": "/p/a.py"}}], "totalFrames": 1}}, {"expect": "scopes", "args": {"frameId": 1000}, "ok": {"scopes": [{"name": "Locals", "variablesReference": 7, "expensive": false}]}}, {"expect": "variables", "args": {"variablesReference": 7}, "ok": {"variables": [{"name": "total", "value": "10", "variablesReference": 0}]}}, {"expect": "next", "args": {"threadId": 1}, "ok": {}}, {"event": "stopped", "body": {"reason": "step", "threadId": 1, "allThreadsStopped": true}}, {"expect": "threads", "ok": {"threads": [{"id": 1, "name": "main"}]}}, {"expect": "stackTrace", "args": {"threadId": 1}, "ok": {"stackFrames": [{"id": 1000, "name": "main", "line": 11, "column": 1, "source": {"path": "/p/a.py"}}], "totalFrames": 1}}, {"expect": "scopes", "args": {"frameId": 1000}, "ok": {"scopes": [{"name": "Locals", "variablesReference": 7, "expensive": false}]}}, {"expect": "variables", "args": {"variablesReference": 7}, "ok": {"variables": [{"name": "total", "value": "11", "variablesReference": 0}]}}, {"expect": "disconnect", "ok": {}}, {"die": true}]}
{"do": "start", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "connect", "conn": "c", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "connect", "conn": "e", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 1, "method": "subscribe"}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 1, "result": true}}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 2, "method": "debug/trust", "params": {"root": "$ROOT/proj", "trusted": true}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 2, "result": true}}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 3, "method": "debug/start", "params": {"root": "$ROOT/proj", "config": "launch:0", "adapters": [{"id": "mock", "name": "Mock", "types": ["mock"], "find": {"path": "$HUB_BIN"}, "start": {"stdio": ["{program}", "debug-mock", "$ROOT/script.json"]}}]}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 3, "result": {"session": "$capture:s"}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"event": "debug-frame", "data": {"session": "$s", "line": 9, "top": true}}, "within_ms": 10000}
